# Keep the Docker build context small and clean.
# node_modules must never leak into an image — pnpm resolves deps inside
# the build (hermetic), and a copied tree breaks platform-specific binaries.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
**/docker-compose*.yml
